{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q15409409","formula":"C₄₉H₅₄F₂N₈O₆","hill":"C49H54F2N8O6","elements":["H","C","N","O","F"],"composition":{"C":49.0,"F":2.0,"H":54.0,"N":8.0,"O":6.0},"names":{"en":"Ledipasvir","ru":"Ледипасвир","uk":"Ледіпасвір"},"descriptions":{"en":"Ledipasvir is a drug for the treatment of hepatitis C that was developed by Gilead Sciences. After completing Phase III clinical trials, on February 10, 2014, Gilead filed for U.S. approval of a ledipasvir/sofosbuvir fixed-dose combination tablet for genotype 1 hepatitis C. The ledipasvir/sofosbuvir combination is a direct-acting antiviral agent that interferes with HCV replication and can be used to treat patients with genotypes 1a or 1b without PEG-interferon or ribavirin. Ledipasvir is an inhibitor of NS5A, a hepatitis C virus protein.","ru":"Ледипасвир (англ. ledipasvir, бывший GS-5885) — препарат для лечения гепатита С, разработанный компанией Gilead Sciences. После завершения III фазы клинических испытаний, 10 февраля 2014 года была подана заявка на утверждение комбинации ледипасвир + софосбувир в лечении гепатита С генотипа 1.","uk":"Ледіпасвір (англ. Ledipasvir, лат. Ledipasvirum) — синтетичний противірусний препарат, який є похідним бензімідазолу, та застосовується перорально."},"fame":21,"pubchemCid":67505836,"mass":889.0,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(C)[C@@H](C(=O)N1CC2(CC2)C[C@H]1C3=NC=C(N3)C4=CC5=C(C=C4)C6=C(C5(F)F)C=C(C=C6)C7=CC8=C(C=C7)N=C(N8)[C@@H]9[C@H]1CC[C@H](C1)N9C(=O)[C@H](C(C)C)NC(=O)OC)NC(=O)OC","inchikey":"VRTWBAAJJOHBQU-KMWAZVGDSA-N","iupac":"methyl N-[(2S)-1-[(6S)-6-[5-[9,9-difluoro-7-[2-[(1R,3S,4S)-2-[(2S)-2-(methoxycarbonylamino)-3-methylbutanoyl]-2-azabicyclo[2.2.1]heptan-3-yl]-3H-benzimidazol-5-yl]fluoren-2-yl]-1H-imidazol-2-yl]-5-azaspiro[2.4]heptan-5-yl]-3-methyl-1-oxobutan-2-yl]carbamate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref